{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-10-27 19:00:00', 'title': 'HII AWARDED $2.4 BILLION TO BUILD AMPHIBIOUS ASSAULT SHIP LHA 9', 'text': "PASCAGOULA, MISS., OCT. 27, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII'S (NYSE:HII) INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION HAS BEEN AWARDED A $2.4 BILLION U.S. NAVY FIXED-PRICE-INCENTIVE CONTRACT FOR THE DETAIL DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION OF AMPHIBIOUS ASSAULT SHIP LHA 9. THE AWARD INCLUDES OPTIONS, THAT IF EXERCISED, WOULD BRING THE CUMULATIVE VALUE OF THE CONTRACT TO $3.2 BILLION. INGALLS WAS AWARDED THE ORIGINAL LONG-LEAD-TIME MATERIAL CONTRACT FOR THE FOURTH SHIP IN THE AMERICA (LHA 6) CLASS ON APRIL 30, 2020."}{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-10-27 09:00:00', 'title': 'HII RECEIVES HIGHEST LEVEL CAPABILITY MATURITY MODEL INTEGRATION (CMMI) RATING', 'text': 'REAFFIRMS COMPANY COMMITMENT TO PROCESS AND QUALITY MANAGEMENT REAFFIRMS COMPANY COMMITMENT TO PROCESS AND QUALITY MANAGEMENT'}